  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiegwa bi’oboagacho bwe Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omorwoti agakwana nomosangererekano bwonsi, agateeba, “Sulemani, omwana one, oyo Omonene Nyasae achorire, nomoke, taramanya amange, na emeremo eye nigo ere emenene. Enyomba eye y’obonene tekoba ase Mwanyabaanto, korende nase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche ase ogokora aya narenge konyara, nabekire ebinto ang’e ase okoagachera enyomba ya Nyasae one: chitaabu ase ebinto bie chitaabu, ne chifeta ase ebinto bie chifeta, ne chitaai ase ebinto bie chitaai, na ebioma ase ebinto bi’ebioma, ne chibao ase ebinto bi’echibao. Amo n’ebinto ebio narure amagena e rigori rinene, buna oiniki na ayande ay’ogosata, ayare nebieni ao ao, akomeka‐meka, amo namagena ande amange amarabu akomeka‐meka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo naende ekiagera nanchire na kwerwa ase enyomba ya Nyasae one, narure ase enyomba eye enchenu chinibo chiane chionsi chi’echitaabu ne chifeta komenta ase ebinto ebio bionsi konya narure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkorua inde chitaabu, chitalanta chilifu isato, korwa ase Ofiri, ne chifeta chichenire chitalanta amagana atano na abere ase okooma chinyasi chi’enyomba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ase emeremo ende yonsi egochia gokorwa nabaroisia ebinto, chitaabu ase ebinto bie chitaabu, ne chifeta ase ebinto bie chifeta. Ning’o ogochia kwerwa ase ogwancha? Oyio tiga eatanane bweka omonyene ase Omonene rituko ria reero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abateneneri be chiamate chiabo bakarua ebiegwa bi’ogwancha; abaraai b’ebisaku na abatang’ani b’abasikari chilifu na ab’amagana, na abateneneri b’emeremo y’omorwoti boigo bakarua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakarua ase emeremo y’enyomba ya Nyasae chitaabu chitalanta chilifu isano ne chidarikoni chilifu ikomi, ne chifeta chitalanta chilifu ikomi, ne chitaai chitalanta chilifu ikomi na isano na isato, na ebioma chitalanta chilifu rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi obwate amagena e rigori rinene akayarua, na amagena ayio akabeekwa ase ekungo y’enyomba y’Omonene, inse y’oborendi bwa Yehieli Omogerisoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bakaba nomogooko, ekiagera bonsi nigo baruete ase ogwancha, na ase chinkoro chieruete ase Omonene. Daudi omorwoti boigo akaba nomogooko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogotogia Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agatogia Omonene ase obosio bw’omosangererekano bwonsi, akabora, “Aye Omonene, Nyasae o Israeli, sokoro yaito, kware gotogigwa korwa kare na gochia kare na kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, obonene nobwao amo nokobua, na obomeka‐meku, na obobui, na obonguru. Ebinto bionsi bire igoro na ebire ase ense nebiao. Aye Omonene, oborwoti nobwao, naye omonyene bweimokereretie igoro okaba omotwe o bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotenenku bwonsi na amasikani nigo bikorwa asore aye, naye okogamba igoro ase bionsi. Ase okoboko kwao chinguru na okobua nao bire; nobwate okobua kw’ogokinia na korua chinguru ase bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Nyasae oito, twakoiraneirie ng’a mbuya mono na gotogia erieta riao ri’obonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende inche ninki ing’isaine, na abanto baane ninki baisaine, goika twanyarire korua ebinto ase ogwancha buna oko? Ebinto bionsi nigo bikorwa asore; ase ayio ebinto biaruete ase okoboko kwao nabio twakoeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe nigo tore ase ense y’obogeni, naende nigo tore abaeti ase obosio bwao, buna chisokoro chiaito chionsi chiarenge; amatuko aito ay’okomenya ase ense nigo anga buna omorengari, na ogosemeria konde tikoiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, aye Omonene, Nyasae oito, ebinto ebi bionsi ebinge twarure ase okoagacha enyomba ase engencho y’erieta riao richenu nigo bikorwa ase okoboko kwao, na bionsi nebiao aye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae one, nimanyete ng’a aye nigo okorenga enkoro, naende nigo ogokirie nayare ay’oboronge. Ase enkoro endonge narure ebinto ebio bionsi nogwancha; na bono narorire abanto bao abare aiga bagokoruera nogwancha, naende ase omogooko omonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, Nyasae o Aburaamu, na o Isaka, na o Israeli chisokoro chiaito, tiga abanto bao, bagenderere koba nekerenga eke na ebirengererio ase chinkoro chiabo botambe kogenderera, naende oonchore chinkoro chiabo chibeere asore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oe Sulemani, omwana one, enkoro yeruete asore, erinde arende amachiiko ao, na oborori bwao, na emeroberio yao echiikire, akore aya onsi na aagache enyomba eria y’obonene nabeire nkobeeka ebinto bionsi ang’e ase okoyeagacha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi agateebia omosangererekano bwonsi, “Togia Omonene, Nyasae oino!” Na omosangererekano bwonsi ogatogia Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, na agwo abanto baria bagatureka emetwe yabo, bagasasiima Omonene naende bakaorokia amasikani ase omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne rituko ria kabere barabwo bakaruera Omonene ebing’wanso, bakamoruera nebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa; chieri elifu eyemo, ne chimingichi elifu eyemo, ne chimanwa chi’eching’ondi elifu eyemo, amo nokoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa gwachikiire amo nabirobio, naende akarua ebing’wanso ebinge ase engencho y’Abaisraeli bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabarabwo bakaria na konywa ase obosio bw’Omonene ase rituko riria, bakaba nomogooko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bono eria kabere bakabeeka Sulemani, mosinto o Daudi, akaba omorwoti obo; bakamoaka amaguta akaba omogambi ase ogokorera Omonene, na Zadoki agaakwa amaguta akaba Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Sulemani agaikaransa ase ekerogo ki’oborwoti bw’Omonene, akaba omorwoti ribaga ria Daudi ise, akaba ogosesenigwa, na Abaisraeli bonsi bakamoigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaraai bonsi, na abanto chituoni, amo nabamura bonsi ba Daudi omorwoti bakaria chiira ng’a mbabwatane nomorwoti Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akaa Sulemani erieta rinene ase egati y’Abaisraeli bonsi, naende akamoa oborwoti bore nobonene obwo ataete omorwoti onde bwensi omotang’anerete agwo ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ameng’e igoro y’okogamba gwa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Daudi, mosinto o Yese, konya ogambeire Abaisraeli bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagambera Abaisraeli emiaka emerongo ene, emiaka etano na ebere (7) agwo Heburoni, na emiaka emerongo etato na etato (33) agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agakwa ore omogotu mono bw’amatuko amange, nigo arenge omonto omonda osikire; na Sulemani, omomura oye, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
